    "title": "Dr. Frank McMeen retires from the Community Foundation of West Tennessee - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Spencer Stadinger ,\n1 days ago JACKSON, Tenn. — One local community gathers to say farewell to one influential leader. The Board of Trustees of the Community Foundation of West Tennessee presented a come-and-go reception to celebrate the retirement of President and CEO Dr. Frank McMeen. McMeen, who is also a Jackson City Councilman, is... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
